# The public website's address for this environment (Phase C, 9.2). Required, with
# no default: the Studio refuses to start or build without a valid absolute http(s)
# URL. "View site" and each published item's Preview link point here, and links in
# the draft preview open here. Copy this file to .env.local (not committed) and set
# the value, or set the variable in the environment of the build.
VITE_PUBLIC_SITE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8765
